[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e94\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_emporium",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That was easier than I expected. Really makes me more and more curious as to what happened in Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps it's the same thing as what happened here, except the roots sank in deeper and the flames burned with more intensity. Don't let your guard down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You should know that I rarely close my eyes when I'm sleeping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. I was trying to end the fighting as soon as possible, but we still ended up damaging so many shops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid Mister Wei is going to end up footing the bill again, especially because he's not fond of the li'l Miss's family in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, it's Swarovski Crystal. Ch'en, isn't this your favorite brand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not really. The pendants are nice, but the earrings aren't that good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Squad B1, Ch'en here. Block the west entrance and lower all the security gates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I rarely see you wear earrings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I'm usually in uniform because of work. The few outfits I do have are gathering cobwebs in my wardrobe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Hoshiguma! This is the L3 floor plan of East Paci Plaza after Reunion modified it. Please look over it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good job. Continue with the investigation, and try to utilize the terrain to our advantage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Afterwards, we'll find the best route to cross Reunion's blockade from here. We can't make do without your information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Clothes, huh... It's hard picturing you as someone who spends money on that kind of stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you the same way with your countless motorbikes? What's wrong with wanting to look nice for yourself every now and then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Work takes up most of my time, but it's not my whole life after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd be more likely to believe you if you didn't show up early every morning like clockwork, as well as taking on overtime hours that would scare anyone else to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess all you can say is that life is tolerable for cops like us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes I ask myself, for those Infected like Amiya... Will they have a chance to go out shopping? Maybe to buy some accessories they like, or eat some of their favorite food?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps one day. But that day is not here yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "C3, Ch'en here. Clear the first floor and push forward slowly. Safety first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess so. This patch of dirt truly is unfair. Ah Faat died, but I get to live on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all died, and only I got to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en. Is that intel really worthwhile?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It has to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(B-bastards...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "(At least I'll bury you with me...!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
